# Smart Grade AI - Project Structure

This is an AI-powered grading system built with modern web technologies.

## Core Architecture
- **Frontend**: React/Next.js with TypeScript for the user interface
- **Backend**: Node.js/Express API or Python FastAPI for AI processing
- **AI/ML**: Integration with language models for automated grading
- **Database**: Store assignments, submissions, and grading results
- **Authentication**: User management for teachers and students

## Directory Structure
```
src/
├── components/     # Reusable UI components
├── pages/         # Application pages/routes
├── api/           # API endpoints and handlers
├── lib/           # Utility functions and helpers
├── types/         # TypeScript type definitions
├── hooks/         # Custom React hooks
├── services/      # External service integrations
├── models/        # Data models and schemas
└── utils/         # General utility functions
```

## Key Features to Implement
- Assignment creation and management
- Student submission interface
- AI-powered grading engine
- Grade review and feedback system
- Analytics and reporting
- User authentication and authorization